# Agent workflow

Read [`AGENTS.md`](../AGENTS.md) first for search-before-create guardrails, entrypoint inventory, and scope rules. This file owns **workflow steps** and **verification commands** only.

## Workflow

1. Do not implement the whole task in one pass.
2. Write a short numbered plan with small, independently testable steps.
3. Execute **one step** at a time.
4. After each step, run the smallest relevant command from the matrix below.
5. Do not continue if tests or smoke checks fail — fix within the current step.
6. Report after each step: what changed, files touched, command run, pass/fail, next step.
7. Prefer minimal diffs; extend existing entrypoints/APIs/UI tabs before creating new ones.
8. Do not combine multiple roadmap packages in one implementation task.

## Verification matrix

Run from repository root with `.\.venv\Scripts\python.exe`.

| Change area | Command |
|-------------|---------|
| Default / any structural change | `.\.venv\Scripts\python.exe -m pytest -q` |
| Rules JSON integrity | `.\.venv\Scripts\python.exe rules_validate_main.py` |
| Architecture gates only | `.\.venv\Scripts\python.exe -m pytest tests/test_architecture_gates.py -q` |
| Adapter / `interfaces/*` / root wrappers | above + `$env:ARE_WATCHDOG_ONCE="1"; .\.venv\Scripts\python.exe watchdog_main.py` and `$env:ARE_WORKER_ONCE="1"; .\.venv\Scripts\python.exe worker_main.py` |
| Test-App / Tk UI | `.\.venv\Scripts\python.exe -m pytest tests/test_desktop_ui_v21.py tests/test_test_app_smoke.py -q` |
| Rule matrix (functional preview) | `.\.venv\Scripts\python.exe rules_matrix_main.py --mode preview` |
| Packaging / bundle | `.\.venv\Scripts\python.exe packaging/build_onedir.py` |
| E2E harness smoke | `.\.venv\Scripts\python.exe main02.py` |

Interpretation hints: [`docs/TESTBASELINE.md`](../docs/TESTBASELINE.md), [`docs/DEDUPE_POLICY.md`](../docs/DEDUPE_POLICY.md), [`docs/KNOWN_ISSUES.md`](../docs/KNOWN_ISSUES.md).

No linter/typechecker is configured — do not invent lint/typecheck steps.
